- Okay.


00:59:18.129 --> 00:59:19.255
Third door on the left.


00:59:19.339 --> 00:59:21.262
- Third door on the left.
- Yeah.


00:59:22.175 --> 00:59:23.552
Big five?


00:59:24.844 --> 00:59:27.814
Jake, go home.


00:59:29.099 --> 00:59:31.852
